  "description": "P0.0 executable target contract for Forgejo and GitHub bootstrap auto-merge after CI. This file is not a live enforcement claim; it defines the script/spec/test chain that prevents regressions to stale contexts, Cargo authority, unpinned PR heads, or operator-only auto-merge procedure.",
