    "reason": "The checked-in scripts/specs/tests enforce the target contract locally. GitHub dev required-status checks now match oya-ci-required, but live authority still requires trusted cloud-ci/oya-ci to post oya-ci-required on candidate SHAs and live Forgejo branch protection/auto-merge convergence."
